# Build context of the web image (ops/caddy/Dockerfile, context = repository root).
# It copies client/, ops/caddy/Caddyfile and the Arcade core only; the app and rtmp images build
# from server/ and ops/rtmp/ with their own rules.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/dist
**/.vite
**/build
**/renderer
**/release
**/logs
**/*.log
**/.cache
**/tmp
**/temp
.claude
.github
desktop
# Client unit tests type-check a few desktop shell modules (the game matcher, the app identity and
# the picker helpers) through relative imports, so the web image build needs the shell's own small
# source files. Its node_modules, release, renderer and icon folders stay out.
!desktop/*.js
!desktop/*.d.ts
!desktop/games
!desktop/picker
mobile
server
# The client imports the Arcade's shared core from the server tree (@arcade/core).
!server/src/arcade/core
ops/data
